ettings that are lists (filter MODE, LFO WAVE and DEST, play MODE, FX and arp TYPE): they are sent 0 - 127, as printed. The mask's 512 values are four controllers, a quarter each, as the manual lays them out.","Kodamo's firmware notes add controllers this manual does not list (CC 16, 17 and 58 - 63 among them, \"check the updated user manual\"); they are not laid out.","Left out, and named: Bank select MSB (CC 0), Modulation wheel (CC 1), Bank select LSB (CC 32), Sustain pedal (CC 64), All sound off (CC 120), All controllers off (CC 121), All notes off (CC 123), Mono mode (CC 126), Poly mode (CC 127)."],"coverage":{"singleParameterWrite":"complete-for-the-manual's-controllers: 73 parameters","realtimeEditing":"complete-for-the-manual's-controllers","editBufferDumpRequest":"notImplemented","editBufferDumpParse":"notImplemented: the manual lists its SysEx messages without their format","bankDump":"notImplemented","inboundControllers":"notImplemented","verifiedOnHardware":false},"timing":{"minDelayBetweenMessagesMs":0},"tests":[{"name":"Pan spread = 100","parameter":"general.panSpread","value":100,"expectedHex":"B0 03 64"},{"name":"Transpose = 100","parameter":"general.transpose","value":100,"expectedHex":"B0 09 64"},{"name":"Osc1 mask 4/4 = 100","parameter":"osc1.osc1Mask44","value":100,"expectedHex":"B0 30 64"}]}}
